# timestep
===
 A SQL-based timeseries viewer for EnergyPlus output. Timestep is a cross-platform desktop app (Electron + React) that loads EnergyPlus simulation results and lets you explore the timeseries interactively — line charts, heatmaps, histograms, scatter plots, and summary statistics — without writing any SQL.
